.DS_Store
.idea
.omx

node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
tmp

*.log
.env
.env.*

agent/
CLAUDE.md
AGENT.md
GEMINI.md
COPILOT.md
.cursorrules
.cursorignore

packages/server/uploads/*
!packages/server/uploads/.gitkeep

**/.terraform
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
